vorite to hold the @SK. "],["pg",""],["ls","wd"],["ls","es"],["hs","ns"],["hs","ss"],["at","South should play a spade to dummy's @SA "],["pg",""],["ls","ns"],["ls","ss"],["pc","s"],["pc","s"],["pc","sa"],["pc","s"],["pg",""],["hs","ns"],["hs","ss"],["hs","es"],["at","and lead a low spade toward the @SQ, hoping East was dealt the @SK."],["",""]]}}